WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.760
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.080
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.360
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.600
And we're best friends.
我们也是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:12.440
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在，我们专为你制作了这档《办公室》终极重温播客。

6
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:19.420
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会剖析一集《办公室》，并分享只有身临其境的我们才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.560
We're The Office Ladies.
我们是《办公室》女士。

8
00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.850
Today is a very special day.
今天是个非常特别的日子。

9
00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:29.750
Yes.
没错。

10
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:34.190
It is the last day that Angela will be in her 40s.
这是安吉拉40多岁的最后一天了。

11
00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:36.150
It is, you guys.
没错，各位。

12
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.610
I am 49, staring at 50.
我49岁了，马上就要50岁了。

13
00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.350
By the time you guys hear this, I'll be 50.
等你们听到这期节目时，我已经50岁了。

14
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:42.150
Yeah.
是啊。

15
00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:43.210
That's crazy.
太疯狂了。

16
00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:44.670
You'll be a hot 50 lady.
你会成为一位火辣的50岁女士。

17
00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:45.890
Ooh, hot 50.
噢，火辣的50岁。

18
00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.050
I was asking you the other day, what does it feel like?
我前几天问过你，感觉如何？

19
00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:54.790
Like, what does 50 feel like as you're approaching this milestone birthday?
就是，当你临近这个里程碑式的生日时，50岁是什么感觉？

20
00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:58.870
I think I've been in denial because I've just been busy with life and kids and whatnot.
我想我一直处于否认状态，因为我一直忙于生活、孩子之类的琐事。

21
00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.690
But I am realizing now it feels big.
但现在我意识到，这感觉意义重大。

22
00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:02.550
You know what I mean?
你明白我的意思吗？

23
00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:05.130
Like, I realize I'm in a different survey group.
就像，我意识到我被归入了不同的调查组。

24
00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:09.190
Like, they're like, Americans, 18 to 35 surveyed.
比如，他们会说，受访者为18到35岁的美国人。

25
00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:12.390
Americans, 35 to 45 surveyed.
受访者为35到45岁的美国人。

26
00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:15.010
I'm like, oh my God, I'm not in the survey anymore?
我就想，天哪，我不在调查范围内了吗？

27
00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:20.490
I'm in the, like, senior citizens surveyed, 50 to 75.
我被归入了，比如，50到75岁的老年受访者组。

28
00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:26.030
You're going to get surveyed about all, like, aches and pains and things now, right?
你现在会开始收到关于各种疼痛和身体状况的调查问卷了，对吧？

29
00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:27.070
You know what?
你知道吗？

30
00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:28.590
My grandmother lived to 100.
我祖母活到了100岁。

31
00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.110
And I'll never forget when she was 96.
我永远忘不了她96岁那年。

32
00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:33.110
Her and I were hanging out.
我和她待在一起。

33
00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:34.250
She was the beSt.
她是最棒的。

34
00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:35.750
Her name was Lena May.
她叫莉娜·梅。

35
00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:38.410
And I said, grandmother, you're about to turn 97.
我说，祖母，你快要97岁了。

36
00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:39.990
How does it feel?
感觉怎么样？

37
00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:44.130
And she said, well, you know, when I'm sitting down, I feel like I'm 23.
她说，嗯，你知道，当我坐着的时候，我觉得自己才23岁。

38
00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.090
It's when I stand up that I feel 97.
只有当我站起来的时候，我才觉得自己有97岁了。

39
00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:48.810
Oh, that's amazing.
噢，太棒了。

40
00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:49.890
Isn't that amazing?
这不是很棒吗？

41
00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:54.170
And then she said, nothing's broken, but none of it really works.
然后她说，虽然没哪里坏掉，但也没哪里真的好用。

42
00:01:57.230 --> 00:02:03.830
So, you guys, I'm very excited today because here I am at work the week of my birthday.
所以，各位，我今天非常兴奋，因为我在生日这一周来上班了。

43
00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:06.890
And that means I'm getting a birthday cake, right?
这意味着我会得到一个生日蛋糕，对吧？

44
00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:10.050
For the first time ever at work.
这是我工作以来第一次。

45
00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:11.090
Sam, do you have it?
山姆，你有吗？

46
00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:11.650
Is it hiding?
它藏起来了吗？

47
00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:13.030
I saw your Arby's bag.
我看到你的阿比快餐袋了。

48
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:13.870
Is it behind it?
它在袋子后面吗？

49
00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:14.590
Nope.
没有。

50
00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:15.450
What?
什么？

51
00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:16.990
Angela?
安吉拉？

52
00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:18.810
Jenna, you said you had something in your car.
珍娜，你说过你的车里有东西。

53
00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:19.750
Is this a ruse?
这是在耍我吗？

54
00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:20.730
No.
没有。

55
00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:26.010
What was in my car is my son's electric guitar that I accidentally brought today.
我车里的是我儿子的一把电吉他，我今天不小心把它带过来了。

56
00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:28.150
I thought it was code for cake.
我以为那是蛋糕的暗号。

57
00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.570
I thought you were going to get cake this whole time.
我一直以为你要去拿蛋糕。

58
00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:31.250
No.
不是。

59
00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:35.310
I mean, I can bring you down to the car and you're going to see a red electric guitar in my trunk.
我是说，我可以带你去车那边，你会看到我后备箱里有一把红色的电吉他。

60
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.470
When I got here, Lee texted me.
我到这儿的时候，李给我发了条短信。

61
00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.590
And I realized I picked him up from guitar last time.
我才意识到上次是我去接他下吉他课的。

62
00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:41.690
I never took it out of the trunk.
我一直没把它从后备箱里拿出来。

63
00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:42.390
Oh, my God.
天哪。

64
00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:42.790
You guys.
你们这些人啊。

65
00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.650
Do you want a red electric guitar?
你们想要一把红色电吉他吗？

66
00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.810
A we could strum happy birthday on it?
我们可以弹着它唱生日快乐歌？

67
00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.210
No, I think this is perfect.
不，我觉得这样挺好的。

68
00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.530
I think I need to finish my 40s never getting cake on my birthday.
我想我得在没有蛋糕的生日中度过我的四十岁了。

69
00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.490
But next year, I want a f***ing cake.
但明年，我想要个他妈的蛋糕。

70
00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:55.270
Okay?
好吗？

71
00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:56.290
I'm going to be 50.
我就要五十岁了。

72
00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.210
It's about f***ing time.
是时候了。

73
00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:04.010
Someone gives me a f***ing cake when I'm at work for my f***ing birthday.
在我生日那天上班时，得有人给我个他妈的蛋糕。

74
00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:05.330
So 51.
所以是五十一岁。

75
00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:07.070
Do you hear me?
你听见了吗？

76
00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:08.270
Do you hear me?
你听见了吗？

77
00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:08.970
I want a cake.
我想要个蛋糕。

78
00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:09.670
Why are you looking directly at me?
你为什么直勾勾地看着我？

79
00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:11.030
And now I'm looking at you.
现在我也在看着你。

80
00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:11.530
Oh, boy.
天呐。

81
00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:14.190
And Cassie, I know you're in there somewhere in the Zoom.
还有凯西，我知道你就在Zoom里的某个地方。

82
00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:15.830
I'm 50.
我五十岁了。

83
00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:17.250
This is what happens when you're 50.
这就是五十岁会发生的事。

84
00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:18.950
You're like, I'm f***ing 50.
你会觉得，老娘都五十岁了。

85
00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:21.110
Give me what I want.
给我我想要的。

86
00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:23.510
Okay.
好的。

87
00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:25.990
I think we all feel really bad.
我想我们都感到很抱歉。

88
00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.490
I would never want you to feel bad, ever.
我绝不想让你感到难过，绝对不想。

89
00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:32.970
Are you messing with me?
你在耍我吗？

90
00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:35.170
Lady, I swear it's an electric guitar.
大姐，我发誓那真的是把电吉他。

91
00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.610
I feel like now.
我现在感觉。

92
00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.210
I mean, you guys, it was really funny.
我是说，你们这些人，这真的很好笑。

93
00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.690
She was like, I have to run to my car.
她当时说，我得跑去车那边一趟。

94
00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:40.230
I know.
我知道。

95
00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.770
Sam, it's about the guitar.
萨姆，那是关于吉他的事。

96
00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.250
And I'm like, this is code for cake.
而我心想，这肯定是蛋糕的暗号。

97
00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:44.390
They're messing with me.
她们在耍我。

98
00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:48.550
Angela, we officially apologize that there is no cake here.
安吉拉，我们正式向你道歉，这里没有蛋糕。

99
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:54.010
I am going to see you tomorrow on your actual birthday to celebrate your actual birthday where
明天你真正的生日那天我会见到你，我们要庆祝你真正的生日，到时候

100
00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:55.210
you will be getting a cake.
你会得到一个蛋糕。

101
00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:55.810
Yes.
好的。

102
00:03:55.850 --> 00:04:00.310
Because I'll be dropping by Gelson's tomorrow tonight to get it.
因为我明晚会顺路去一趟杰尔森超市把它买回来。

103
00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:02.190
Because by God, you're getting a cake.
因为天哪，你必须得有个蛋糕。

104
00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:02.750
Okay?
好吗？

105
00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:03.310
Okay.
好的。

106
00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:04.930
Okay.
好的。

107
00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:05.410
All right.
行吧。

108
00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:05.850
Done.
成交。

109
00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:10.190
This week, we are talking about The Surplus.
这周我们要聊的是《盈余》这一集。

110
00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:17.070
It is Season 5, Episode 10, written by Gene Stepnitzki and Lee Eisenberg and directed by
这是第五季第十集，由吉恩·斯泰普尼茨基和李·艾森伯格编剧，导演是

111
00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.030
Paul Feig.
保罗·费格。

112
00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.470
Do you want to hear a fun little tidbit about the title?
你们想听听关于这个标题的一个有趣的小花絮吗？

113
00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:21.190
Yes.
想。

114
00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.850
As you guys know, I am a digital hoarder.
如你们所知，我是个数字囤积狂。

115
00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:26.050
And every once in a while, it brings me a real nugget.
偶尔，它会给我带来真正的宝贝。

116
00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:30.710
I found an email from Randy Cordray saying that we were tentatively going to be shooting
我翻到一封兰迪·科德雷的邮件，说我们暂定在2008年10月拍摄

117
00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:34.990
this episode in October of 2008, end of October.
这一集，十月底。

118
00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:39.890
And the title, the working title was Spend the Surplus.
当时的暂定标题是《花掉盈余》。

119
00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:40.650
Oh!
噢！

120
00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:42.030
Spend the Surplus.
《花掉盈余》。

121
00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:44.270
And then we just dropped the spend.
后来我们把“花掉”去掉了。

122
00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:44.830
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

123
00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:45.490
Okay.
好的。

124
00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:49.390
So as you watch this, know that we're filming end of October 2008.
所以当你们看这一集时，要知道我们是在2008年10月底拍摄的。

125
00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:52.730
I went on a website that tells you whether years passed.
我上了一个能查往年天气的网站。

126
00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:54.890
You guys, the high was 88 degrees.
伙计们，最高气温有88华氏度。

127
00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:55.730
In October.
在十月份。

128
00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:56.250
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

129
00:04:56.430 --> 00:05:00.590
And if you watch us shivering outside, know that that's a fakie shiver.
如果你们看到我们在外面瑟瑟发抖，要知道那是装出来的。

130
00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:04.390
Oh, I have some things to say about that when we get there.
噢，等聊到那儿的时候，我有些话要说。

131
00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:04.790
Okay.
好的。

132
00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.630
I'm going to hit you with a summary.
我来给你们做个剧情梗概。

133
00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:07.210
Do it.
请讲。

134
00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:15.390
But Oscar informs Michael there is a $4,300 budget surplus that must be spent today or
奥斯卡告诉迈克尔，有4300美元的预算盈余必须在今天花掉，否则

135
00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:17.930
it gets returned and taken out of next year's budget.
这笔钱会被收回，并从明年的预算中扣除。

136
00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:23.730
The office is then divided on what to spend it on, new chairs or a new copier.
办公室里因此产生了分歧，大家在买新椅子还是新复印机之间争论不休。

137
00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:28.010
This creates tension between Jim and Pam, who are on opposing sides.
这导致了吉姆和帕姆之间的紧张关系，他们站在了对立面。

138
00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:29.710
Pam is team chairs.
帕姆是“椅子派”。

139
00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:31.230
Jim is team copier.
吉姆是“复印机派”。

140
00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:31.590
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

141
00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:35.910
Andy and Angela visit Shroot Farms to discuss their wedding with Dwight.
安迪和安吉拉去施鲁特农场和德怀特商量他们的婚礼。

142
00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:39.530
Michael then learns of a third option for the surplus.
迈克尔随后得知了盈余的第三种处理方案。

143
00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:44.030
He can return it in exchange for a 15% bonus for himself.
他可以把钱退回去，换取他个人15%的奖金。

144
00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:46.030
What will he choose?
他会怎么选呢？

145
00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.690
Well, he doesn't like to make anyone mad, but he also wants the money.
嗯，他不想惹任何人不高兴，但他又想要那笔钱。

146
00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:50.690
Yeah.
没错。

147
00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:51.230
Mm.
嗯。

148
00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:57.850
Fast fact number one, the character of Ryan does not appear in this episode.
冷知识第一条，瑞安这个角色没有出现在这一集中。

149
00:05:58.150 --> 00:05:59.110
Good catch.
观察得很仔细。

150
00:05:59.490 --> 00:05:59.690
Yeah.
是啊。

151
00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.790
Remember last week he told Kelly he was going to go to Thailand?
还记得上周他告诉凯莉他要去泰国吗？

152
00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:09.930
Well, this marks his first episode on his vacation, and he will be gone for 11 weeks
嗯，这标志着他度假的第一集，他将离开11周

153
00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:14.510
because he was filming Inglourious Bastards, the Quentin Tarantino film.
因为他要去拍昆汀·塔伦蒂诺的电影《无耻混蛋》。

154
00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.770
This was such a big deal for BJ.
这对BJ来说是件大事。

155
00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:17.990
We were so excited.
我们都太兴奋了。

156
00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.450
He was working with Brad Pitt.
他要和布拉德·皮特合作了。

157
00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:20.430
I know.
我知道。

158
00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:24.170
We really hit him up for Brad Pitt stories, and he had nothing.
我们真的缠着他要布拉德·皮特的八卦，但他什么都没说。

159
00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.530
He just said he was a nice guy.
他只说他是个好人。

160
00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.050
We're like, come on, give us something.
我们就像说，拜托，给我们爆点料吧。

161
00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:27.770
I know.
我知道。

162
00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.310
And then he would drop and do like a one-arm push-up.
然后他就会突然趴下做单手俯卧撑。

163
00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:31.390
BJ, we get it.
BJ，我们懂了。

164
