839
00:35:36.090 --> 00:35:36.350
Yeah.
见过。

840
00:35:36.770 --> 00:35:38.370
For the cat lover in your life.
送给你生命中那位爱猫人士。

841
00:35:38.530 --> 00:35:40.090
Put that next to the butter.
把它放在黄油旁边。

842
00:35:40.410 --> 00:35:42.050
Cat pooping butter.
拉黄油的猫。

843
00:35:42.550 --> 00:35:43.450
Happy birthday.
生日快乐。

844
00:35:45.070 --> 00:35:45.910
Next year.
明年吧。

845
00:35:46.050 --> 00:35:46.750
Next year.
明年。

846
00:35:46.890 --> 00:35:47.430
That's it.
就这么定了。

847
00:35:47.650 --> 00:35:49.190
